Subject: [PATCH 3/9] Two tests held the rule each agreement's terms replaced,
 so they read the agreement now

tests/propay.test.ts called coveredWork, the one rule for every agreement that went when each agreement got its own
terms; it reads coveredUnder on the same agreement, a legit department's first terms, with the same answers.
tests/pro-work.test.ts held that a role an agent can submit for never came openly while represented; a voice part or
work abroad an agreement leaves out now comes openly, as its terms say, so the check reads whether the agreement covers
the role.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HBdcuKzBBMbipfFQSByALG
